{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkB4eRXeUBB94CR9fQRH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0135z3f1wHQobm5EDbMrQKQj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'E'\np='src/view/bust.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    this.dimmed = null; this.bx = 0;\n  }\"\"\",\"\"\"    this.dimA = 1; this.dimTarget = 1; this.mats = null;\n  }\n  /** The listener dims. Own material copies, so the shared palette materials stay as they are. */\n  setDim(on) {\n    this.dimTarget = on ? 0.5 : 1;\n    if (this.mats) return;\n    this.mats = [];\n    this.object.traverse((m) => { if (m.isMesh) { const c = m.material.clone(); m.material = c; this.mats.push({ c, base: c.color.clone() }); } });\n  }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  update(dt) {\n    this.t += dt;\n    const k = Math.min(1, dt * 12);\"\"\",\"\"\"  update(dt) {\n    this.t += dt;\n    if (this.mats && Math.abs(this.dimA - this.dimTarget) > 0.005) {\n      this.dimA += (this.dimTarget - this.dimA) * Math.min(1, dt * 9);\n      for (const { c, base } of this.mats) c.color.copy(base).multiplyScalar(this.dimA);\n    }\n    const k = Math.min(1, dt * 12);\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/stages/story.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"      v.leanTarget = on ? 1 : 0;\\n\",\"      v.leanTarget = on ? 1 : 0;\\n      v.setDim(!on);\\n\")\ns=s.replace(\"if (on) { v.setEmotion !== undefined; if (v.emotion !== beat.emo) v.setEmotion(beat.emo); }\",\"if (on) { if (v.emotion !== beat.emo) v.setEmotion(beat.emo); }\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/view/field.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    // Droplets.\n    for (const d of state.drops)\"\"\",\"\"\"    // The thread, from the last stitch to the needle.\n    for (const s of state.seats) {\n      if (s.table !== table || s.tool !== 'suture' || !s.useHeld) continue;\n      const lac = state.ents.find((e) => e.k === 'laceration' && e.table === table && e.tied > 0);\n      if (lac) { const f = (lac.tied - 0.5) / lac.slots, x = lac.a[0] + (lac.b[0] - lac.a[0]) * f, z = lac.a[1] + (lac.b[1] - lac.a[1]) * f; line(buf, PX(x), PY(z), PX(s.x), PY(s.z), C.stitchHi, 1); }\n    }\n    // Droplets.\n    for (const d of state.drops)\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/stages/title.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"if (this.sub) { this.sub.update(ctx, dt); this.sub?.draw(ctx); app.devices.idle = 0; return; }\",\"if (app.devices.idle >= 10) { import('./flow.js').then(({ startAttract }) => startAttract()); }\\n    if (this.sub) { this.sub.update(ctx, dt); this.sub?.draw(ctx); return; }\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (this.difficulty) { this.updateDifficulty(ctx); return; }\n    if (app.devices.idle >= 10) { import('./flow.js').then(({ startAttract }) => startAttract()); }\n\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (this.difficulty) { this.updateDifficulty(ctx); return; }\n\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nfor f in ['src/stages/log.js','src/stages/consult.js']:\n    s=open(f).read()\n    s=s.replace(\"    devs.poll(ctx, dt);\\n    this.t += dt;\\n    this.set.update(dt); app.director?.update(dt);\\n    this.figs\",\"    devs.poll(ctx, dt);\\n    if (devs.idle >= 10) { import('./flow.js').then(({ startAttract }) => startAttract()); }\\n    this.t += dt;\\n    this.set.update(dt); app.director?.update(dt);\\n    this.figs\")\n    s=s.replace(\"    app.devices.poll(ctx, dt);\\n    this.t += dt;\\n    this.set.update(dt); app.director?.update(dt);\\n    setView(ctx, [3.8\",\"    app.devices.poll(ctx, dt);\\n    if (app.devices.idle >= 10) { import('./flow.js').then(({ startAttract }) => startAttract()); }\\n    this.t += dt;\\n    this.set.update(dt); app.director?.update(dt);\\n    setView(ctx, [3.8\")\n    open(f,'w').write(s)\nE\ncat > docs/AUTHORING.md <<'EOF'\n# Authoring Second Stitch\n\nEverything below is plain data. No engine knowledge needed for the first three.\n\n## Add an operation\n1. Add an `op({...})` block in `src/content/ops/index.js`: `id`, `n`, `title`, `arena`, `surgeon`, `gifts`, `tools`, `patient` (name, age, job, hook, objective, `followUp` for S A B C), `time`, `vitals`, `doses`, `music`, `stages`.\n2. A stage is `{ id, say, spawn, begin, timed, on, until, then, hint, music, skipIf, jump }`.\n   - `spawn` entries: `{ k, id, at, ... }`. Kinds are in `src/sim/entities.js` (`pool, bleeder, nick, laceration, incision, hook, prop, magnet, tumor, core, stalk, plate, organ, fragment, clamp, graft, polyp, egg, eye, cyst, clot, mask, dressing, marker, strain`). `hiddenBy: 'p1'` hides under another; `scan: true` needs the Scanner.\n   - `until`: `{ clear:[kinds] }`, `{ flag }`, `{ meta }`, `{ time }`, `{ sids:[ids] }`, `{ all:[...] }`, `{ any:[...] }`.\n   - Commands (in `begin`, `then`, `timed`, entity `then`): `say, spawn, remove, removeKinds, unlock, setDrain, music, camera, flag, codeBlue, massage, vitals, setVitals, fake, composure, hurt, pain, cold, pinkUp, sfx, voice, fx, prompt, mimic, heart, noHeart, addTime, tag, win`.\n3. Add it to `CAMPAIGN` in `src/sim/campaign.js` (and `CAMPAIGN_OPS`, `CONSULT_OPS` if wanted).\n4. `node tests/balance.mjs --write` sets its `par` from the full-skill bot. `node tests/run.mjs sim` checks idle fails, the bot clears, determinism and network sizes.\n\nDev Mode: Pause, Dev Mode, JUMP goes to any stage; ACTIONS has Copy Op JSON to Console. URL flags: `?op=op5&stage=1&diff=attending&seed=3&god=1`, `?scene=ep4`, `?attract=1`, `?menu=1`.\n\n## Add a scene\nAdd to `src/content/scenes/index.js`: `{ id, title, set, music, cast:[left,right], figures:[[who,[x,z],clip]], beats:[{ who, emo, say, cam:'wide', cue, swap, other }] }`. Emotions: neutral stern shock sad smile angry panic. Two wrapped lines at most; `*word*` highlights; the font has no em dash or ellipsis characters, so type `-` and `...`. `node tests/run.mjs content` lints all of this.\n\n## Add a character\nAdd to `src/content/cast.js`: display name, `skinHex`, gibberish `voice` (`timbre`, `base`, `speed`, `range`) and `look` (hair style, cap, scrubs, extras). Bust and figure are built from it in `src/content/models/index.js`. `node check.mjs --sheets src/content/models/index.js` draws every def.\n\n## Add a strain\n1. A state machine in `src/sim/strains/index.js`: `{ step(sim, e, dt), on(sim, e, signal, entity, seat) }`, registered in `STRAINS`. Keep state plain data on `e`; randomness comes from `rangeOf(sim, ...)`. Spawn working parts as entities with `owner: e.id` and `sig: 'name'`; they signal `on` when finished.\n2. A creature in `src/view/strains.js` (`make` and `update`).\n3. A theme in `src/content/songs.js`, signature sounds in `src/content/sfx.js`.\n\n## The one rule\n`src/sim` and non-model content import nothing from the engine, the DOM or the clock. Sim state must survive `structuredClone`. That is what makes The Second Look, determinism, the bot, Node tests, the hub's server copy and network snapshots possible.\n\n## Tests and build\n`node tests/run.mjs [sim|content|browser|hub]` prints only failures and a count (needs `npm install playwright@1.63.0`). `node tools/build.mjs` writes `dist/game.html` and the deliverable in the parent folder.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs; timeout 300 node tests/browser/tour.mjs ep7 ep9 ep5 2>&1 | tail -4; cd shots; magick ep7.png ep9.png ep5.png +append -resize 1800x m5.png; cd ..","description":"Dim listeners, draw thread, idle attract, authoring doc, recheck sets","timeout":310000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2968,"cache_read_input_tokens":466146,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2968},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9464247a-cdba-4289-905c-cd8b34e5d270","uuid":"0fe7877b-0b4a-491e-81c6-254cc6dd03e9","timestamp":"2026-11-05T1