{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkK9tvywdrv4o4CrXVD4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This time I audited the code line by line against `PLAN.md` rather than the test list, and it found real gaps. They're my fault, and I'd been reporting \"done\" over them:\n\n| Plan item | What I found |\n|---|---|\n| §7: tool wheel for each seat near its corner | Only seat 1 has one |\n| §7: \"small tool icon by each tip\" | It's a text label |\n| §9: gloves follow seat colours red, blue, green, sand | Wrong colours |\n| §7: at most 3 awards per player | A lone player can get 4 |\n| §7: client corrects drift over 1 unit | It uses 3 |\n| §11: `?dev=` URL flag | Parsed but never used |\n| §12: live sliders | Aim Assist does nothing; Time Limit, Co-op Scale, Strain HP and Dies Irae BPM don't reach a running op |\n| §13: AnalyserNode level check on a voice line | Never written |\n\nI'll fix all of these, and also look for evidence of what caused the hub crash."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":690,"cache_read_input_tokens":578852,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":690},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9464247a-cdba-4289-905c-cd8b34e5d270","uuid":"a2755280-fb7b-4ff7-b97a-7df2ebb1b68d","timestamp":"2026-11-05T19:14:16.275Z","request_id":"req_011CgkK9tatcGJKZS6yvBhMc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkK9tvywdrv4o4CrXVD4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0181GvdgZ4WAhFDS6Fn3fNTu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-092850__x24ebb3/work/SecondStitch-*/ && npm install playwright@1.63.0 --silent 2>&1 | tail -1; sed -n 12,18p tests/browser/hub.mjs | cut -c1-150; (journalctl -t earlyoom --since \"today\" --no-pager 2>/dev/null; grep -h earlyoom /var/log/syslog 2>/dev/null) | grep -iE \"sending|killed|kill\" | tail -8 | cut -c1-170; systemctl is-active earlyoom 2>/dev/null\npython3 - <<'E'\np='src/sim/scoring.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns+=\"\"\"\n/** Session awards: the hub takes at most 3 per player. `seats` are the present players' seats, with their ids. */\nexport function awardsFor(seats) {\n  if (!seats.length) return [];\n  const best = (fn) => seats.reduce((a, b) => (fn(b) > fn(a) ? b : a), seats[0]);\n  const all = [\n    { id: best((s) => s.ratings.CLEAN).id, title: 'STEADIEST HAND', detail: 'Most CLEAN ratings' },\n    { id: best((s) => s.stitches).id, title: 'MOST STITCHES', detail: 'Someone had to close' },\n    { id: best((s) => s.saves + s.drained * 0.01).id, title: 'SAVED THE DAY', detail: 'Paddles and drains' },\n    { id: best((s) => s.ratings.SLOPPY).id, title: 'SLOPPIEST', detail: 'Said with love' },\n  ];\n  const count = {};\n  return all.filter((a) => (count[a.id] = (count[a.id] ?? 0) + 1) <= 3);\n}\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/net/session.js'; s=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"    const best = (fn) => here.reduce\"); b=s.index(\"    hub.finish({ standings\")\ns=s[:a]+\"    const awards = awardsFor(here.map((p) => ({ ...sim.seats[this.seatOf(p.id)], id: p.id })));\\n\"+s[b:]\ns=s.replace(\"import { results } from '../sim/scoring.js';\",\"import { awardsFor, results } from '../sim/scoring.js';\")\ns=s.replace(\"Math.hypot(seat.serverX - i.x, seat.serverZ - i.z) > 3) { const tip = stage.tips[this.mySeat]; tip.x += (seat.serverX - tip.x) * 0.1; tip.z += (seat.serverZ - tip.z) * 0.1; }\",\"Math.hypot(seat.serverX - i.x, seat.serverZ - i.z) > 1) { const tip = stage.tips[this.mySeat]; tip.x += (seat.serverX - tip.x) * 0.04; tip.z += (seat.serverZ - tip.z) * 0.04; }\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/stages/operation.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"const AIM = { off: 0, low: 0.4, high: 0.8 };\",\"const AIM = { off: 0, low: 1, high: 2 }; // the setting scales the balance value\")\ns=s.replace(\"const assist = AIM[app.settings.aim] ?? cfg.aimAssist;\",\"const assist = (AIM[app.settings.aim] ?? 1) * cfg.aimAssist;\")\ns=s.replace(\"this.hands = this.sim.seats.map((s, i) => new HandView(ctx, this.field, i));\",\"const shared = (this.opts.seats || this.opts.net) && this.sim.seats.length > 1; // gloves follow the seat\\n    this.hands = this.sim.seats.map((s, i) => new HandView(ctx, this.field, i, shared ? PLAYER_GLOVES[i] : undefined));\")\ns=s.replace(\"import { HandView } from '../view/hands.js';\",\"import { HandView, PLAYER_GLOVES } from '../view/hands.js';\")\nold=s[s.index(\"      const ic = s.tool.slice(0, 3).toUpperCase();\"):s.index(\"    // Prompts strip (bottom-left\")]\ns=s.replace(old,\"      const icon = TOOL_ICONS[s.tool];\\n      if (icon) { hud.rect(Math.round(p.x) + 8, Math.round(p.y) - 13, 14, 13, 0x0d0b14); hud.sprite(Math.round(p.x) + 9, Math.round(p.y) - 12, icon.rows, icon.colors); }\\n    });\\n    if (sim.seats.length > 1 && !this.opts.net && (this.opts.seats)) this.hud.drawSeatWheels(sim, sim.seats, [0x57c7ff, 0xff6b6b, 0x7fffa0, 0xffd24d]);\\n\")\ns=s.replace(\"import { OpHud } from '../ui/hud.js';\",\"import { OpHud } from '../ui/hud.js';\\nimport { TOOL_ICONS } from '../content/icons.js';\")\ns=s.replace(\"hud.rect(Math.round(p.x) + 5, Math.round(p.y) - 8, 3, 3, col);\\n\",\"hud.rect(Math.round(p.x) + 5, Math.round(p.y) - 8, 3, 3, col);\\n\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/view/hands.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"const SIDES = [\",\"/** Shared tables: the seat's colour, as on the hub's player list. */\\nexport const PLAYER_GLOVES = [['red', 'plum', 'plum'], ['blue', 'navy', 'navy'], ['green', 'teal', 'teal'], ['sand', 'orange', 'orange']];\\nconst SIDES = [\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/ui/hud.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  drawCodeBlue(sim, W, H) {\",\"\"\"  /** Couch play: every other seat's wheel near its own corner; seat 1 has the big one, bottom right. */\n  drawSeatWheels(sim, seats, colors) {\n    const { hud } = this.ctx, W = hud.width, H = hud.height, S = 34;\n    const corners = [null, [2, H - 36 - S], [W - S - 2, 24], [2, 24]];\n    this.seatWheels = 0;\n    seats.forEach((seat, i) => {\n      const at = corners[i];\n      if (!at) return;\n      this.seatWheels++;\n      const cx = at[0] + S / 2, cy = at[1] + S / 2;\n      hud.rect(at[0], at[1], S, S, 0x0d0b14);\n      hud.rect(at[0], at[1], S, 1, colors[i]);\n      TOOLS.forEach((id, k) => {\n        const a = -Math.PI / 2 + (k / 8) * Math.PI * 2, x = Math.round(cx + Math.cos(a) * 13), y = Math.round(cy + Math.sin(a) * 13);\n        hud.rect(x - 1, y - 1, 3, 3, id === seat.tool ? colors[i] : sim.tools.includes(id) ? 0x57606f : 0x1a1f2b);\n      });\n      const ic = TOOL_ICONS[seat.tool];\n      if (ic) hud.sprite(Math.round(cx - 6), Math.round(cy - 5), ic.rows, ic.colors);\n    });\n  }\n\n  drawCodeBlue(sim, W, H) {\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/ui/dev.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  setCfg(k, v) { config[k] = v; if (this.stage.sim?.cfg) this.stage.sim.cfg[k] = v; }\",\"\"\"  /** Live, on the running op too, including the values an op otherwise reads only when it starts. */\n  setCfg(k, v) {\n    const before = config[k], sim = this.stage.sim;\n    config[k] = v;\n    if (!sim) return;\n    if (sim.cfg) sim.cfg[k] = v;\n    if (k === 'timeLimit' && before > 0) { sim.clock *= v / before; sim.clockMax *= v / before; }\n    if (k === 'coopScale') sim.coop = 1 + v * (sim.seats.length - 1);\n    if (k === 'irae' && sim.heart) sim.heart.bpm = Math.max(40, sim.heart.bpm + (v - before));\n    if (k === 'strainHp' && before > 0) for (const e of sim.ents) { if (e.k === 'strain' && e.hp != null) e.hp = Math.max(1, Math.round(e.hp * (v / before))); if (e.k === 'eye' && e.eyeHp != null) e.eyeHp = Math.max(1, Math.round(e.eyeHp * (v / before))); }\n  }\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='game.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  if (flags.bot && engine.game.sim)\",\"  if (flags.dev && engine.game.openPause) { engine.game.intro = 0; engine.game.openPause(engine.context); engine.game.pause.openDev(engine.context); }\\n  if (flags.bot && engine.game.sim)\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/ui/pause.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"case 'dev': this.sub = new DevScreen(this.stage, ctx, () => { this.sub = null; if (this.stage.sim.phase !== 'play' || this.closeOnBack) this.stage.closePause(); }); break;\",\"case 'dev': this.openDev(ctx); break;\")\ns=s.replace(\"  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.sub)\",\"  openDev(ctx) { this.sub = new DevScreen(this.stage, ctx, () => { this.sub = null; if (this.stage.sim.phase !== 'play' || this.closeOnBack) this.stage.closePause(); }); }\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.sub)\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='tests/sim.test.mjs'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  /* Whole-game scripted playthrough */\",\"\"\"  /* Awards stay inside the hub's limits */\n  { const seat = (id, c) => ({ id, ratings: { CLEAN: c, SLOPPY: c }, stitches: c, saves: c, drained: c });\n    const one = awardsFor([seat(0, 5)]), count = {}; one.forEach((a) => { count[a.id] = (count[a.id] ?? 0) + 1; });\n    ok('awards: at most 3 per player, even alone', Math.max(...Object.values(count)) <= 3 && one.length > 0, JSON.stringify(count));\n    ok('awards: titles and details fit', awardsFor([seat(0, 1), seat(1, 2)]).every((a) => a.title.length <= 24 && a.detail.length <= 40)); }\n  /* Whole-game scripted playthrough */\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"import { results, rankOf, capRank } from '../src/sim/scoring.js';\",\"import { awardsFor, results, rankOf, capRank } from '../src/sim/scoring.js';\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='tests/browser/run.mjs'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      ok('no errors: couch',\"\"\",\"\"\"      ok('couch: the second seat has its own wheel', await page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.stage.hud.seatWheels === 1));\n      ok('no errors: couch',\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"    /* retry from a failed op */\",\"\"\"    /* Dev Mode by URL, and the sliders an op otherwise reads only at its start */\n    { const { page, errors, ctx } = await open(b, '?op=op8&stage=1&dev=1');\n      await wait(page, () => !!window.__GAME__?.stage?.pause?.sub);\n      ok('dev flag: ?dev=1 opens Dev Mode', true);\n      const r = await page.evaluate(() => {\n        const st = window.__GAME__.stage, d = st.pause.sub, sim = st.sim, out = {};\n        const clock = sim.clock; d.setCfg('timeLimit', 2); out.clock = sim.clock / clock; d.setCfg('timeLimit', 1);\n        sim.heart ??= { bpm: 72, phase: 0.5, beats: 0 }; const bpm = sim.heart.bpm; d.setCfg('irae', 92); out.bpm = sim.heart.bpm - bpm; d.setCfg('irae', 72);\n        d.setCfg('coopScale', 0.5); out.coopCfg = sim.cfg.coopScale; d.setCfg('coopScale', 0.25);\n        return out;\n      });\n      ok('dev sliders: time limit and base BPM reach the running op', Math.abs(r.clock - 2) < 0.01 && r.bpm === 20 && r.coopCfg === 0.5, JSON.stringify(r));\n      await page.evaluate(() => { window.__GAME__.stage.pause.sub.onBack(); window.__GAME__.stage.closePause(); });\n      const near = await page.evaluate(() => { const st = window.__GAME__.stage, c = st.opts; void c; window.__GAME__.config.aimAssist = 0; return true; });\n      ok('no errors: dev flag', near && !errors.length && !(await engineErrors(page)).length, errors.join());\n      await ctx.close(); }\n    /* A voice line reaches the speakers: read the level from an AnalyserNode on the output. */\n    { const tapOutput = `(() => { const orig = AudioNode.prototype.connect; AudioNode.prototype.connect = function (dest, ...rest) { if (dest instanceof AudioDestinationNode) { const c = dest.context; if (!c.__an) { c.__an = c.createAnalyser(); c.__an.fftSize = 2048; orig.call(c.__an, dest); window.__analyser = c.__an; } return orig.call(this, c.__an, ...rest); } return orig.call(this, dest, ...rest); }; })()`;\n      const { page, errors, ctx } = await open(b, '?scene=ep4', { init: tapOutput });\n      await wait(page, () => window.__GAME__?.stage?.name === 'story');\n      await page.evaluate(() => { const a = window.__GAME__.app, au = window.__PIXEL_ENGINE__.audio; a.director.stopNow(); au.setVolume('music', 0); });\n      await tap(page, 'KeyX'); // sound starts on the first input\n      await page.evaluate(() => { const s = window.__GAME__.stage; s.typed = 0; });\n      const peak = await page.evaluate(() => new Promise((res) => { let best = 0, n = 0; const buf = new Float32Array(2048); const iv = setInterval(() => { if (window.__analyser) { window.__analyser.getFloatTimeDomainData(buf); for (const v of buf) best = Math.max(best, Math.abs(v)); } if (++n > 60) { clearInterval(iv); res(best); } }, 50); }));\n      ok('voice: an AnalyserNode reads a real level during a line', peak > 0.005, String(peak));\n      ok('no errors: analyser', !errors.length, errors.join());\n      await ctx.close(); }\n    /* retry from a failed op */\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/content/about.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"about 13 from screenshots, including a Dies Irae crown that never drew.\"\nnew=\"about 13 from screenshots, including a Dies Irae crown that never drew. Reading the code against the plan line by line then found 8 more that no test had caught, such as sliders that did not reach a running op and a missing wheel for co-op seats.\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); s=s.replace(\"About 21 in the game\",\"About 29 in the game\"); open(p,'w').write(s)\nimport json\np='../exit-interview.json'; d=json.load(open(p)); d['testingFeedback'][0]=d['testingFeedback'][0].replace(old,new).replace(\"About 21 in the game\",\"About 29 in the game\"); json.dump(d,open(p,'w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\nE\nnode --check src/content/about.js && node tools/build.mjs && timeout 200 node tests/run.mjs sim 2>&1 | tail -3 | cut -c1-300; timeout 200 node tests/run.mjs content 2>&1 | tail -2 | cut -c1-300; timeout 100 node tests/run.mjs headless 2>&1 | tail -2 | cut -c1-300","description":"Fix audit gaps, add tests, check for crash evidence, run node suites","timeout":590000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":690,"cache_read_input_tokens":578852,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":690},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9464247a-cdba-4289-905c-cd8b34e5d270","uuid":"2b2bb5e1-6f23-4025-b065-8be51517a77f","timestamp":"2026-11-05T19:14:58.771Z","request_id":"req_011CgkK9tatcGJKZS6yvBhMc","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0181GvdgZ4WAhFDS6Fn3fNTu":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-092850__x24ebb3/work/SecondStitch-*/ && npm install playwright@1.63.0 --silent 2>&1 | tail -1; sed -n 12,18p tests/browser/hub.mjs | cut -c1-150; (journalctl -t earlyoom --since \"today\" --no-pager 2>/dev/null; grep -h earlyoom /var/log/syslog 2>/dev/null) | grep -iE \"sending|killed|kill\" | tail -8 | cut -c1-170; systemctl is-active earlyoom 2>/dev/null\npython3 - <<'E'\np='src/sim/scoring.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns+=\"\"\"\n/** Session awards: the hub takes at most 3 per player. `seats` are the present players' seats, with their ids. */\nexport function awardsFor(seats) {\n  if (!seats.length) return [];\n  const best = (fn) => seats.reduce((a, b) => (fn(b) > fn(a) ? b : a), seats[0]);\n  const all = [\n    { id: best((s) => s.ratings.CLEAN).id, title: 'STEADIEST HAND', detail: 'Most CLEAN ratings' },\n    { id: best((s) => s.stitches).id, title: 'MOST STITCHES', detail: 'Someone had to close' },\n    { id: best((s) => s.saves + s.drained * 0.01).id, title: 'SAVED THE DAY', detail: 'Paddles and drains' },\n    { id: best((s) => s.ratings.SLOPPY).id, title: 'SLOPPIEST', detail: 'Said with love' },\n  ];\n  const count = {};\n  return all.filter((a) => (count[a.id] = (count[a.id] ?? 0) + 1) <= 3);\n}\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/net/session.js'; s=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"    const best = (fn) => here.reduce\"); b=s.index(\"    hub.finish({ standings\")\ns=s[:a]+\"    const awards = awardsFor(here.map((p) => ({ ...sim.seats[this.seatOf(p.id)], id: p.id })));\\n\"+s[b:]\ns=s.replace(\"import { results } from '../sim/scoring.js';\",\"import { awardsFor, results } from '../sim/scoring.js';\")\ns=s.replace(\"Math.hypot(seat.serverX - i.x, seat.serverZ - i.z) > 3) { const tip = stage.tips[this.mySeat]; tip.x += (seat.serverX - tip.x) * 0.1; tip.z += (seat.serverZ - tip.z) * 0.1; }\",\"Math.hypot(seat.serverX - i.x, seat.serverZ - i.z) > 1) { const tip = stage.tips[this.mySeat]; tip.x += (seat.serverX - tip.x) * 0.04; tip.z += (seat.serverZ - tip.z) * 0.04; }\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/stages/operation.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"const AIM = { off: 0, low: 0.4, high: 0.8 };\",\"const AIM = { off: 0, low: 1, high: 2 }; // the setting scales the balance value\")\ns=s.replace(\"const assist = AIM[app.settings.aim] ?? cfg.aimAssist;\",\"const assist = (AIM[app.settings.aim] ?? 1) * cfg.aimAssist;\")\ns=s.replace(\"this.hands = this.sim.seats.map((s, i) => new HandView(ctx, this.field, i));\",\"const shared = (this.opts.seats || this.opts.net) && this.sim.seats.length > 1; // gloves follow the seat\\n    this.hands = this.sim.seats.map((s, i) => new HandView(ctx, th