{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: Not clearly met. The deliverables are present and the automated suites pass, but the last assistant message itself lists gaps: the §7 client drift correction (1 unit) has no dedicated test, Co-op Scale is only checked as a stored setting, and Aim Assist and Strain HP sliders are untested. The §7 and §9 fixes (per-seat wheels, seat-coloured gloves) are marked only as seen in a screenshot, not verified by a test. The plan's §9 placement numbers were changed, and the hub crash at 3 of 5 remains unexplained. These are items the plan does require on this computer, so completeness is not established by the transcript."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9464247a-cdba-4289-905c-cd8b34e5d270","uuid":"444ab7ad-cb55-412d-8a15-15cb4291a2d7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T20:02:53.131Z","isSynthetic":true}
