, 'Eight tools']],\n  ['World, characters', ['Six main cast', 'Eleven scenes', 'Each scene is 8', 'Every patient has']],\n  ['Infrastructure for more', ['docs/AUTHORING.md', 'Dev Mode: Actions', 'src/sim imports nothing']],\n  ['Dev mode from pause', ['Pause: Resume', 'Every slider has', 'Pause, Dev Mode']],\n  ['Attract after 10', ['Attract: starts', 'Attract reel']],\n  ['Controller-first', ['Mouse, stick, triggers', 'Keys play an op', 'Prompts follow', 'Menus by pad']],\n  ['No dense data', ['Settings: at most about 8 rows']],\n  ['Touch-only gate', ['Touch-only: exact text']],\n  ['Tests behind one', ['Whole game: Node walk']],\n  ['No TODOs', ['No TODOs']],\n  ['Source Information', ['About: every source field', 'About and the exit interview agree', 'Exit interview: 4, 6 and 4']],\n];\nconst items16 = section('## 16.').split('\\\\n').filter((l) => l.startsWith('| ') && !l.startsWith('| The brief')).map((l) => l.slice(2).split(' | ')[0]);\nfor (const it of items16) covers('16 table', it, MAP16);\n\nconst bad = rows.filter((r) => !r.ok);\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"T: a test that passed on this run. V: a value read from data or from the running page. F: a file on disk.\",\"T: a test that passed on this run. V: a value read from data or from the running page. F: a file on disk. P: an item read from PLAN.md itself (the section 13 list, section 12 targets, section 16 table), which fails if nothing covers it.\")\ns=s.replace(\"T('13', 'Attract: starts, key and pad exit, save untouched'\",\"T('13', 'Attract: starts, key and pad exit, save untouched'\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nE\ngrep -c \"T('13', 'Touch-only: exact text\" tests/plan-check.mjs; N=$(basename $PWD); {\nnpm install playwright@1.63.0 --silent 2>&1 | tail -1\ntimeout 200 node tests/run.mjs sim 2>&1 | tail -6 | cut -c1-260\n} ; cmp dist/game.html ../$N.html && echo testing-the-deliverable","description":"Read plan lists from PLAN.md in the checker; add missing tests; run sim","timeout":320000}}}
