{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkTvmNkVozYBQwWCfJTb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan's own checklists are now verified item by item, and everything holds on the shipped build. The checker reads the §13 test list, the §12 balance targets and the §16 \"Done means\" table directly from `PLAN.md`, so I no longer choose what gets checked. Any item without evidence would fail, and none did.\n\n| From `PLAN.md` itself | Items | Hold |\n|---|---|---|\n| §13 test list (21 bullets, plus sound, hub and kit from its prose) | 24 | 24 |\n| §12 balance targets | 4 | 4 |\n| §16 \"Done means\" table | 18 | 18 |\n| Other requirement rows (from before) | 124 | 124 |\n| **Total** | **170** | **170** |\n\nI do still choose which evidence counts for each item, and that mapping is in `tests/plan-check.mjs` if you want to check it.\n\n## Gaps this closed\nThese were all missing tests, and the game passed each once it had one:\n- Drain by pad stub alone had never been tested. A new test steers with the stick to the pool and holds R2.\n- The §12 balance targets were printed by a report but never asserted. Now they're tests: skill 0.4 clears Ops 1–3, skill 0.7 clears all with mostly A or B and enough clock left, and skill 1.0 gets S on all.\n- The §13 \"save and unlock\" check had no unlock part. It now confirms the Log and Consult unlock.\n\n## Final pass\nIt ran as one uninterrupted pass from 14:00 to 14:08, with no game code changed. The shipped file's hash was `ca43919793d3b2dd` before and after.\n\n| Step | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `node tests/run.mjs`, every suite | 655 passed, 0 failed |\n| `node tests/plan-check.mjs`, using that run's passed tests | 170 of 170 hold |\n| `check.mjs` on the page, `--headless` with keys, and `--sheets` | all exit 0 |\n\n## What can't be closed\n- **The old hub crash:** it happened on an earlier build, and its error and process are gone, so the cause can't be confirmed now. A dead page does give that exact error, and it hasn't recurred on this build.\n- **How the game feels:** that takes a person playing it. TASK.md says a person or real hardware is \"never required\".\n\nThe condition is met, and I'm finished. If the hook fires again over those two points, no further run here can change them, so `/goal clear` is the way to end it. The Source Information and the three feedback sections in my earlier message are unchanged, and nothing is committed to git.\n\nFiles are in `work/`:\n- `SecondStitch-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-092850.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `SecondStitch-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-092850/` (dev folder, with `docs/PLAN-CHECK.md` and screenshots in `shots/`)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1078,"cache_read_input_tokens":671907,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1078},"output_tokens":770,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9464247a-cdba-4289-905c-cd8b34e5d270","uuid":"421953d5-4288-4a4e-b01a-2d94d249c814","timestamp":"2026-11-05T21:08:42.284Z","request_id":"req_011CgkTvka7mg5efUNdaNuG5"}
